WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.313
Lab 1 is in the developer workbook's
Chapter 3, on a laptop with no tenant.

2
00:00:05.313 --> 00:00:08.272
You render the morning
of November sixteenth,

3
00:00:08.272 --> 00:00:11.778
when the Entra diagnostic
setting stopped overnight,

4
00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:15.361
the probe didn't run and a
domain controller went silent:

5
00:00:15.361 --> 00:00:19.022
four telemetry rows flagged;
sync, risk, emergency access,

6
00:00:19.022 --> 00:00:23.151
grants and admin changes all stale;
and the Active Directory tab,

7
00:00:23.151 --> 00:00:26.812
whose sources are fresh,
flagging the silent controller.

8
00:00:26.812 --> 00:00:29.948
Then you render the next
morning, run the replication

9
00:00:29.948 --> 00:00:33.512
probe on a saved replication
report, and check reachability.

10
00:00:33.512 --> 00:00:37.970
And when you try to record the first
render as evidence, the kit refuses.
